### URL mal formada: deberia dar 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/analisis
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "esto-no-es-una-url"
}

### URL vacia: deberia dar 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/analisis
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": ""
}

### Origen invalido: deberia dar 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/analisis
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://ejemplo.com",
  "origen": "telepatia"
}

### Listar los ultimos analisis
GET http://localhost:8080/api/analisis

### Listar solo 5
GET http://localhost:8080/api/analisis?limite=5